# Design system — Hybrid (Design D)

**Full doc:** `docs/DESIGN-DECISIONS.md`  
**Reference UI:** `src/components/dashboard/layout/dashboard-kpi-bento.tsx` + `src/components/dashboard/admin.tsx` / `owner.tsx`

## Chosen direction

- **Hybrid:** Bento for KPI/summary **top**; Classic for charts, tables, forms, lists **below**.
- **Not for daily ops:** Editorial dark-rail (Design C).

## When to use Bento

Hero KPI + sparkline, compact metric tiles, order-status strip with progress bars.  
Use `Card border-border/60 shadow-sm`, 12-col grid, `bg-accent/10` icon wells.

**Never** bento-wrap full data tables, settings, or long forms.

## When to use Classic

`DashboardSection` / `DataPanel`, `TimeRangeToggle`, chart+panel splits, full-width tables, `Section` form blocks, `EmptyState`.  
No accent-bar titles (`before:bg-accent`).

## Primitives (reuse — don’t duplicate)

- Dashboard: `src/components/dashboard/layout/` (`DashboardShell`, `DashboardHeader`, `DashboardKpiBento`, `DashboardSection`, `WidgetGrid`, `TimeRangeToggle`, `OrderStatusSection`)
- Pages/lists: `src/components/page/` (`PageHeader`, `Section`, `DataPanel`, `StatStrip`, `StatMetric`)
- Auth: `src/components/auth/layout/` (`AuthShell`, `AuthHeader`, …)
- UI: shadcn via `src/components/ui/*` adapters
- Toolbar actions: `ActionButton` / `LinkActionButton` (`action-button-variants.ts`) — **Design B · Soft** (`primary` tinted, `secondary` muted). `LinkButton` is an alias.

## Visual-only default

UI tasks: preserve hooks, routes, validation, and API contracts unless explicitly changing behavior.

## Buttons in forms

Use `type="submit"` on primary form actions; do not default all buttons to `type="button"`.

## CSS build note

In standalone `.css` files use legacy tokens (`text-body`, `border-border-base`); semantic `text-muted-foreground` only in TSX / `main.css` `@layer`.
